{"id":"n61283-1-56","stage":1,"title":"위험 · 危险","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61283-1-56-1","ko":"넌 군인이 그렇게 좋니?","zh":"你那么喜欢军人吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"군인이","meaning":"军人","explanation":"군인：军人；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"군인","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62241","senseId":"1","lemma":"군인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그렇게","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋니?","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"8be042648e2b4352","term":"군인","zh":"军人","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3","entryId":"62241","definition":"隶属于军队并接受使用武器等的军事训练，承担一定任务的人。","pronunciation":["구닌"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0b0ba957b39d1ac09d90.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61283-1-56-2","ko":"우리나라가 위험에 처했을 때 군인들이 우리를 지켜 주잖아.","zh":"国家有危险的时候，是军人在保护我们啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리나라가","meaning":"我们国家，我国","explanation":"우리나라：我们国家，我国；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리나라","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70403","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리나라","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"위험에","meaning":"危险","explanation":"위험：危险；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"위험","audio":"/audio/baaff05e434f85e30d88.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61283","senseId":"1","lemma":"위험","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"처했을","meaning":"处于，面临","explanation":"처하다：处于，面临；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"처하다","audio":"/audio/a6c76f913746331b75de.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78027","senseId":"1","lemma":"처하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时候","explanation":"때：时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"5","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"군인들이","meaning":"军人","explanation":"군인：军人；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"군인","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62241","senseId":"1","lemma":"군인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"우리를","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지켜","meaning":"守护，保卫","explanation":"지키다：守护，保卫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"지키다","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29754","senseId":"1","lemma":"지키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주잖아.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c32807440d40f0d8","term":"우리나라","zh":"我们国家，我国","audio":"/audio/c32807440d40f0d826c4.mp3","entryId":"70403","definition":"韩国人用于指称自己的国家。","pronunciation":["우리나라"]},{"id":"baaff05e434f85e3","term":"위험","zh":"危险","audio":"/audio/baaff05e434f85e30d88.mp3","entryId":"61283","definition":"有受害或受伤的可能，不安全；或指该状态。","pronunciation":["위험"]},{"id":"a6c76f913746331b","term":"처하다","zh":"处于，面临","audio":"/audio/a6c76f913746331b75de.mp3","entryId":"78027","definition":"处在某种状态或境地中。","pronunciation":["처ː하다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"在某种状况下。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"8be042648e2b4352","term":"군인","zh":"军人","audio":"/audio/8be042648e2b43520bd1.mp3","entryId":"62241","definition":"隶属于军队并接受使用武器等的军事训练，承担一定任务的人。","pronunciation":["구닌"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"43f3170b8d3dc6fa","term":"지키다","zh":"守护，保卫","audio":"/audio/43f3170b8d3dc6fa99c2.mp3","entryId":"29754","definition":"为了使财产、利益、安全等不丢失或遭受外界的侵犯而保护或监视并阻止。","pronunciation":["지키다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9f1439d04df2fa029f8f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.627,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61283","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":56,"sequenceScore":2.4537,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["国家有危险的时候，是军人在保护我们啊。","你那么喜欢军人吗？","雨季都结束了，怎么还会下整整一周的雨啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你那么喜欢军人吗？","雨季都结束了，怎么还会下整整一周的雨啊。","国家有危险的时候，是军人在保护我们啊。"],"answer":2}]